{"5026530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liminal Angel", "steam_appid": 5026530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror roguelike where planning your survival is everything. The game is split into two parts: a preparation phase, where you gather resources and trade with NPCs, and the main expedition through 3 dangerous realms. You are on a strict timer. Every time you die, you lose precious time, cutting your chances of success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons have possessed wild beasts and domestic animals alike, turning them against humanity. You are the last surviving angel, sent to Earth by God. Your goal is to save mankind by reaching the heart of the plague and destroying the demon core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARATION &amp; TRADING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping wood and mining stone are your main ways to make money. You can trade your resources with the villagers to buy unique items that will help you survive the trip ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANDOMNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness is key to every run. You will face different times of day, varying stat upgrades, and completely different villagers each time. Your path to the demon core always features 3 realms, randomly chosen from a much larger pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRETS &amp; SURVIVORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every realm hides its own secrets and items that make traveling through it easier. Make sure to interact with the villagers, because talking to them and learning their stories directly helps with your preparations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/6f03c7963ea7d592c486be586c6eb7a2.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror roguelike where planning your survival is everything. The game is split into two parts: a preparation phase, where you gather resources and trade with NPCs, and the main expedition through 3 dangerous realms. You are on a strict timer. Every time you die, you lose precious time, cutting your chances of success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/4afd43cde17c0b077f280b5f72eee491.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons have possessed wild beasts and domestic animals alike, turning them against humanity. You are the last surviving angel, sent to Earth by God. Your goal is to save mankind by reaching the heart of the plague and destroying the demon core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PREPARATION &amp; TRADING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/dc9524b4ad742762ddb788001340e796.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chopping wood and mining stone are your main ways to make money. You can trade your resources with the villagers to buy unique items that will help you survive the trip ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANDOMNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/1972258332d23e3de655965632b51f77.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness is key to every run. You will face different times of day, varying stat upgrades, and completely different villagers each time. Your path to the demon core always features 3 realms, randomly chosen from a much larger pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRETS &amp; SURVIVORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.poster.avif?t=1788111608\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.webm?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/extras/394f700bf8fcc79fbf1d9aeaa96fe92a.mp4?t=1788111608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every realm hides its own secrets and items that make traveling through it easier. Make sure to interact with the villagers, because talking to them and learning their stories directly helps with your preparations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆◆</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Demons have possessed the wildlife, turning animals against humanity. As an angel in human form, you must prepare for a perilous journey. Meet the survivors without revealing your true identity, gather your gear, and evade demon-possessed beasts before dawn breaks. (Roguelike)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/c5309852fabbae956a46b49d8b5e67c4114a3c2b/header.jpg?t=1788111608", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/cbccf924b9ee3451d1cb88a5b7c38b33bf1bc8a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788111608", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026530/cbccf924b9ee3451d1cb88a5b7c38b33bf1bc8a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788111608", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requir